{"id":"n81472-3-6","stage":5,"title":"통 · 度量","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81472-3-6-1","ko":"오늘은 어떤 선배가 졸업식에 와준 후배들에게 고맙다고 모두에게 밥을 사 줬어.","zh":"今天有位学长为了感谢来参加毕业典礼的后辈们，给大家请吃了饭呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"선배가","meaning":"学长，师兄，师姐","explanation":"선배：学长，师兄，师姐；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"선배","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66306","senseId":"2","lemma":"선배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선배가","audio":"/audio/69cdfd3e309e8f036045.mp3"}},{"text":"졸업식에","meaning":"毕业典礼","explanation":"졸업식：毕业典礼；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"졸업식","audio":"/audio/4a0af5b7df82c96a1c24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75874","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸업식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"졸업식에","audio":"/audio/9b523bd3c10a67386f90.mp3"}},{"text":"와준","meaning":"来，来参加；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와준","audio":"/audio/1cbf5fe4493f7b57d831.mp3"}},{"text":"후배들에게","meaning":"学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈","explanation":"후배：学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"후배","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73247","senseId":"2","lemma":"후배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후배들에게","audio":"/audio/b7cc164279212423a262.mp3"}},{"text":"고맙다고","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고맙다고","audio":"/audio/f334ad44fa952278acc6.mp3"}},{"text":"모두에게","meaning":"都，全","explanation":"모두：都，全；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두에게","audio":"/audio/09e66335ea9492047eda.mp3"}},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥을","audio":"/audio/59f360b400889823dcc4.mp3"}},{"text":"사","meaning":"请客，付账，买单","explanation":"사다：请客，付账，买单；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"5","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사","audio":"/audio/98ebd37ce3c1cd6abbe7.mp3"}},{"text":"줬어.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줬어","audio":"/audio/71e4d6f04c5b2aec4173.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"5a64f841df328061","term":"선배","zh":"学长，师兄，师姐","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3","entryId":"66306","definition":"比自己先进入同一个学校的人。","pronunciation":["선배"]},{"id":"4a0af5b7df82c96a","term":"졸업식","zh":"毕业典礼","audio":"/audio/4a0af5b7df82c96a1c24.mp3","entryId":"75874","definition":"纪念学生修完由学校规定的全部课程而举行的仪式。","pronunciation":["조럽씩"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"d1877a494d990fd1","term":"후배","zh":"学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3","entryId":"73247","definition":"同一学校内比自己入学晚的人。","pronunciation":["후ː배"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"都，全","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"28135","definition":"一个不漏，全都。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"请客，付账，买单","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"支付与他人一起吃饭的费用。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/044d45b6920b0500ac41.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81472-3-6-2","ko":"정말? 통이 시원한 분이시구나.","zh":"真的吗？真是个大气的人啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"통이","meaning":"度量，心胸","explanation":"통：度量，心胸；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"통","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81472","senseId":"3","lemma":"통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통이","audio":"/audio/42604f379b41608aa67b.mp3"}},{"text":"시원한","meaning":"爽快，痛快","explanation":"시원하다：爽快，痛快；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"4","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원한","audio":"/audio/eb75ec9a411a296929cc.mp3"}},{"text":"분이시구나.","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분이시구나","audio":"/audio/443bad560812bb5788e7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"837d5d028930fb39","term":"통","zh":"度量，心胸","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3","entryId":"81472","definition":"人的胸怀。","pronunciation":["통"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"爽快，痛快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"语言流畅，行为直率活泼。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2c4f503f69128d81155.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.333,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81472","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.4631,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的吗？真是个大气的人啊。","今天有位学长为了感谢来参加毕业典礼的后辈们，给大家请吃了饭呢。","你知道这部电影什么时候开始上映吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天有位学长为了感谢来参加毕业典礼的后辈们，给大家请吃了饭呢。","你知道这部电影什么时候开始上映吗？","真的吗？真是个大气的人啊。"],"answer":2}]}
